<title>FRANCE: EU sells 5,201 tonnes German intervention rye.</title>
<headline>EU sells 5,201 tonnes German intervention rye.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday sold 5,201 tonnes of German intervention rye for export to non-EU countries at a minimum price of 103.43 Ecus per tonne, member country officials said. --Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
